%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral', 'flowchart': {'curve': 'basis'}}}%%
flowchart LR
    subgraph Inputs
        Cues["User cues / sensor data"]
        Tools["External tools & APIs"]
    end

    Cues -->|context| WM[Working Memory<br/>Redis]
    Tools -->|results| WM

    WM -->|persist important<br/>episodes| EM[Episodic Memory<br/>MongoDB + Qdrant]
    WM -->|immediate facts| Facts[User Facts<br/>MongoDB]
    EM -->|evidence links| Facts

    subgraph Consolidation
        Facts -->|conflict resolution| Sem[Semantic Memory<br/>MongoDB + Qdrant]
        EM -->|distillation + temporal scoring| Sem
        Sem -->|knowledge graph updates| Facts
    end

    Sem -->|generalized instructions| Proc[Procedural Memory<br/>MongoDB]
    EM -->|trajectory examples| Proc
    Proc -->|executable skills<br/>(code + parameters)| Exec[Skill Runner / Agents]
    Exec -->|feedback metrics| WM
    Exec -->|execution traces| EM

    Sem -->|context retrieval| WM
    Facts -->|personalization| WM

